{"text": "One day, they met Baviaan, the wise old baboon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was the wisest animal in all of South Africa. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Where did all the animals go, asked the Leopard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Baviaan winked and said, They went into other spots. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My advice to you, Leopard, is to go into other spots as soon as you can. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the hunter asked, And what about me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You should change, too, as soon as you can, said Baviaan. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They did not understand, but they went to look for the forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After many days, they saw a great, tall forest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Inside, the tree trunks were covered with spots and stripes of shadow. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is dark here, but full of little pieces of light, said the Leopard.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "d", "a", "y", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "m", "e", "t", " ", "B", "a", "v", "i", "a", "a", "n", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "s", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "b", "a", "b", "o", "o", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "s", "e", "s", "t", " ", "a", "n", "i", "m", "a", "l", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "o", "f", " ", "S", "o", "u", "t", "h", " ", "A", "f", "r", "i", "c", "a", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "a", "n", "i", "m", "a", "l", "s", " ", "g", "o", ",", " ", "a", "s", "k", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "L", "e", "o", "p", "a", "r", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "a", "v", "i", "a", "a"